      "type": "action",
      "folder": null,
      "system": {
        "description": {
          "gm": "",
          "value": "<p>Whenever the tallow ooze takes fire damage, it becomes quickened for 1 round (it can only Stride or Strike with the extra action). Whenever the tallow ooze is dealt cold damage (even if that damage is prevented by its resistance), it becomes slowed 1 for 1 round and can't use its Engulf ability (but creatures already engulfed are still engulfed).</p>"
        },
